OL,3,AViagogo may have broken law on hidden
OL,4,Afees, watchdog provisionally finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FTicket-reselling site Viagogo may have
OL,7,Fbroken the law on hidden fees, the UK's
OL,8,Fcompetition body has said in a
OL,9,Fprovisional finding.
OL,11,FThe Competition and Markets Authority
OL,12,F(CMA) said it found that Viagogo failed
OL,13,Fto show consumers the total price
OL,14,Fupfront when they were buying tickets
OL,15,F"and added fees later in the process, a
OL,16,Fpractice known as drip pricing".
OL,18,FThe CMA added that this was an initial
OL,19,Ffinding, and it should not be assumed
OL,20,Fthat the company had actually broken
OL,21,Fthe law.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
