OL,3,AViagogo may have broken law on hidden
OL,4,Afees, watchdog provisionally finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Viagogo said it was
OL,7,Fco-operating fully with the CMA, adding
OL,8,Fthat the investigation was continuing
OL,9,Fand "no final findings have been made".
